Package: estimatrZero
Title: Fast Estimators for Design-Based Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alex Coppock [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Alex Coppock <acoppock@gmail.com>
Description: A lean rewrite of estimatr targeting the DeclareDesign workflow.
    Provides lm_robust, lm_lin, iv_robust, lh_robust, difference_in_means, and
    horvitz_thompson with heteroskedasticity- and cluster-robust standard
    errors, feols-style fixed effects absorption, and design-aware
    Horvitz-Thompson variance. Interfaces match estimatr; several long-standing
    correctness bugs are fixed.
